# Quiz System Current Milestone Rules

Current Phase 8B scope includes only these units:

Quiz Portal Home
Available Quiz List
Empty Quiz State
Locked Quiz State as Available Quiz List Canvas modal/panel
Quiz Instructions
Quiz Session Shell
Multiple Choice Single Presenter
Multiple Choice Multiple Presenter
True/False Presenter
Unsupported Item State
Submit Confirmation
Quiz Result Screen
Quiz Error/Retry State

Do not implement other quiz item presenters unless explicitly approved.

Use Canvas/uGUI for the Phase 8B quiz UI.

The Available Quiz List `View` action must open an in-screen Canvas modal/panel, not a separate scene.

The modal must preserve subject filter, scroll position, selected row, and loaded list data.

Use existing generated UI sprites and components first.

Do not hardcode quiz content in UI scripts.

Quiz UI must use shared stores, services, presenters, DTOs, and provider interfaces.

The Quiz Portal must be separate from future adventure missions.

Quiz completion must not update mission progress.

Quiz result display may show score, feedback, pass/fail, and optional display-only stars or badges. It must not grant spendable coins, inventory items, EXP, cosmetics, or shop currency.
